00:55:04.360 --> 00:55:06.400
I really enjoyed their conversation.
我很喜欢他们的交谈。

1221
00:55:06.560 --> 00:55:08.960
We're just so happy to share about their podcaSt.
我们很高兴能分享他们的播客。

