And there is a tradition where he makes a video of Sophia and Liam reaching into a bowl and picking out the numbers for the order of the draft.
而且有一个传统，他会拍一段视频，让索菲亚和利亚姆把手伸进碗里，抽出选秀顺序的号码。

1233
00:55:47.200 --> 00:55:53.160
That's how all these guys find out their pick number is from Sophia and Liam every year.
这就是这群人每年如何从索菲亚和利亚姆那里得知自己选秀顺位的方式。

1234
00:55:53.280 --> 00:55:54.680
I love our office family.
我爱我们的办公室大家庭。

1235
00:55:54.820 --> 00:55:55.420
I love it.
我太爱了。

1236
00:55:55.840 --> 00:56:03.260
Well, you guys, Michael's getting desperate and he's going to do that classic thing that Michael does where he has to go up on stage and take the microphone.
好了，各位，迈克尔开始急了，他要使出迈克尔那招经典的把戏——上台去抢麦克风。

1237
00:56:03.920 --> 00:56:04.280
Yeah.
是啊。

1238
