It's amazing.
这太绝了。

1245
00:56:18.740 --> 00:56:21.100
I mean, security comes pretty quickly.
我是说，保安来得挺快的。

1246
00:56:21.700 --> 00:56:22.140
Yes.
没错。

1247
00:56:22.140 --> 00:56:22.460
I know.
我知道。

1248
00:56:22.580 --> 00:56:24.140
With Lori like marching right in front.
洛里直接气势汹汹地走在最前面。

1249
00:56:24.460 --> 00:56:24.740
Yeah.
是啊。

1250
00:56:24.740 --> 00:56:26.120
It's not going to go great.
这绝对不会有什么好结果。

1251
00:56:26.340 --> 00:56:27.960
They're going to leave with no interns.
他们离开时将招不到任何实习生。

1252
00:56:28.280 --> 00:56:31.460
They're going to leave with no interns and no one ever wanting to work there.
他们离开时将招不到任何实习生，而且再也不会有人想去那里工作了。

1253
00:56:31.680 --> 00:56:32.240
Thanks, Michael.
谢谢你，迈克尔。

1254
00:56:32.240 --> 00:56:40.280
Well, speaking of Dunder Mifflin and working there, we should probably catch you up on how it's going between little Dwight and Angela back at the office.
说到邓德米弗林和在那里的工作，我们大概该跟你说说小德怀特和安吉拉在办公室进展得怎么样了。

1255
00:56:40.600 --> 00:56:42.400
First, they had to make some copies.
首先，他们得去复印。

1256
00:56:42.860 --> 00:56:46.700
I took a screen grab of this scene of us making copies.
我把我们复印这个场景截了图。

1257
00:56:46.880 --> 00:56:50.720
It really perfectly shows how much they had to crop me out.
这真的很完美地展现了他们把我裁掉了多少。

1258
00:56:50.960 --> 00:56:51.460
Oh, yeah.
哦，对。

1259
00:56:51.620 --> 00:56:52.600
Your shoulders up.
只留了你的肩膀以上。

1260
00:56:52.780 --> 00:56:53.520
I know.
我知道。

1261
00:56:53.940 --> 00:56:56.440
Can I say something that I noticed about this scene?
我能说一件我注意到关于这个场景的事吗？

1262
00:56:56.900 --> 00:56:57.280
Okay.
好啊。

1263
00:56:57.660 --> 00:56:59.740
There's only two people in the office.
办公室里只有两个人。

1264
00:56:59.740 --> 00:57:00.380
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1265
00:57:00.640 --> 00:57:03.440
Apparently, you need to make copies at the same time.
显然，你们需要同时复印。

1266
00:57:03.540 --> 00:57:04.780
So there's a line.
所以排起了队。

1267
00:57:05.300 --> 00:57:05.600
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1268
00:57:05.940 --> 00:57:07.860
There's also a copier in the annex.
附楼里其实也有一台复印机。

1269
00:57:08.460 --> 00:57:11.240
I think Angela just wanted to stand close to him.
我觉得安吉拉只是想靠近他站着。

1270
00:57:11.440 --> 00:57:12.760
I think she did, too.
我也觉得她是这么想的。

1271
00:57:13.060 --> 00:57:15.220
I think her heart is melting a little.
我觉得她的心有点融化了。

1272
