You know, it's taken her a bit.
你知道的，这花了他不少时间。

1273
00:57:17.380 --> 00:57:19.160
He did freeze her cat.
他毕竟冻死了她的猫。

1274
00:57:20.180 --> 00:57:22.920
So she's had a lot to unpack there.
所以她有很多心结要解开。

1275
00:57:23.120 --> 00:57:24.700
But I think she's softening.
但我认为她正在变软心肠。

1276
00:57:25.000 --> 00:57:26.780
Well, Dwight's going to sneeze.
看，德怀特要打喷嚏了。

1277
00:57:27.340 --> 00:57:29.340
And Angela's going to say, bless you.
然后安吉拉要说，保重。

1278
00:57:29.740 --> 00:57:30.340
I know.
我知道。

1279
00:57:30.560 --> 00:57:31.780
I think it's the beginning.
我觉得这是个开始。

1280
00:57:32.120 --> 00:57:34.680
The beginning of the Angela and Dwight rekindling.
安吉拉和德怀特重燃爱火的开始。

1281
00:57:35.240 --> 00:57:37.620
And I have more evidence.
而且我还有更多证据。

1282
00:57:37.780 --> 00:57:39.200
If you needed more.
如果你还需要的话。

1283
00:57:40.100 --> 00:57:40.700
What?
什么？

1284
00:57:40.980 --> 00:57:44.620
As they're leaving for the day, Dwight holds the door.
当他们下班离开时，德怀特扶着门。

1285
00:57:44.800 --> 00:57:47.000
He waits and holds the door for Angela.
他等着并为安吉拉扶着门。

1286
00:57:47.180 --> 00:57:48.800
And she says, thank you.
然后她说，谢谢你。

1287
00:57:49.200 --> 00:57:49.840
I know.
我知道。

1288
00:57:49.980 --> 00:57:56.480
I mean, this is, in their language, like, this is on again, almoSt.
我的意思是，在他们的语境里，这简直就像是，快要复合了。

1289
00:57:56.940 --> 00:57:57.400
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

1290
00:57:57.700 --> 00:58:00.020
They're about to go to the warehouse and hook up.
他们快要去仓库鬼混了。

1291
00:58:00.360 --> 00:58:00.580
Right.
对。

1292
00:58:00.780 --> 00:58:01.160
Exactly.
没错。

1293
00:58:02.000 --> 00:58:02.440
Exactly.
没错。

1294
00:58:02.760 --> 00:58:04.040
That's about to happen.
这马上就要发生了。

1295
00:58:04.480 --> 00:58:07.640
Well, back at the golf course, turns out Kevin did okay.
好了，回到高尔夫球场，凯文表现得还不错。

1296
00:58:07.760 --> 00:58:11.240
He wants to collect his money from all of his winnings.
他想收回他所有的赢钱。

1297
00:58:11.320 --> 00:58:13.180
But Mr. McGuire says, no, no, no.
但麦奎尔先生说，不，不，不。

1298
00:58:13.240 --> 00:58:16.000
We'll start a tab because I'm going to play more golf with you guys.
我们先记个账，因为我还要和你们一起打高尔夫。

1299
00:58:16.470 --> 00:58:16.720
Hmm.
嗯。

1300
00:58:17.060 --> 00:58:22.120
He'll play more golf with them, but he refuses still to give Jim his business.
他会跟他们打更多的高尔夫，但仍然拒绝把生意交给吉姆。

1301
00:58:22.580 --> 00:58:24.600
But Jim isn't going to take no for an answer.
但吉姆是不会罢休的。

1302
00:58:24.860 --> 00:58:28.520
No, he's going to throw himself in front of this man's car.
不，他打算直接冲到这人的车前面去。

1303
00:58:29.000 --> 00:58:29.360
Yeah.
是啊。

1304
00:58:29.600 --> 00:58:32.240
I found it a little off-putting.
我觉得这有点让人反感。

1305
00:58:32.520 --> 00:58:36.560
Jim said he said he would call him every day until he gave him his business.
吉姆说他放话了，会天天打电话，直到对方把生意交给他。

1306
00:58:36.900 --> 00:58:39.180
Well, it works on Mr. McGuire.
好吧，这一招对麦圭尔先生还真管用。

1307
00:58:39.420 --> 00:58:42.100
I feel like Jim is using Dwight's sales tactics.
我觉得吉姆在用德怀特的销售策略。

1308
00:58:44.540 --> 00:58:49.740
He's certainly exercising persistence, and I guess it pays off.
他确实够坚持的，我想这总算有了回报。

1309
00:58:50.200 --> 00:58:53.160
Mr. McGuire says, okay, there you go.
麦圭尔先生答应了，行吧，就这么着。

1310
00:58:53.360 --> 00:58:54.100
It worked.
成功了。

1311
00:58:54.420 --> 00:58:59.300
And they're going to come back to the office, and they're going to be drinking some beers,
然后他们会回到办公室，喝着啤酒，

1312
