toasting their good fortune as Michael and Pam and Oscar and Daryl return from the job fair.
庆祝他们的好运气，而迈克尔、帕姆、奥斯卡和达里尔则从招聘会回来了。

1313
00:59:06.340 --> 00:59:08.420
And Pam is like, you did it.
帕姆就会说，你做到了。

1314
00:59:08.520 --> 00:59:09.400
You closed the deal.
你拿下了这笔生意。

1315
00:59:09.580 --> 00:59:10.120
You sold it.
你卖出去了。

1316
00:59:10.120 --> 00:59:12.260
And she runs up, and they smooch.
然后她跑过去，他们亲吻了。

1317
00:59:12.500 --> 00:59:14.660
Then they shake hands because they're, like, awkward.
接着他们握了握手，因为他们觉得有点尴尬。

1318
00:59:14.880 --> 00:59:18.380
And then they completely make out in front of everyone.
然后他们在所有人面前来了个法式深吻。

1319
00:59:18.920 --> 00:59:20.660
Angela, I remember shooting this scene.
安吉拉，我还记得拍这场戏的时候。

1320
00:59:21.060 --> 00:59:22.020
P.D.A.
当众秀恩爱。

1321
00:59:22.180 --> 00:59:22.700
Awkward.
太尴尬了。

1322
00:59:23.060 --> 00:59:25.220
We were kissing for so long.
我们吻了太久了。

1323
00:59:25.220 --> 00:59:26.840
It felt like a long time.
感觉时间好长。

1324
00:59:27.220 --> 00:59:31.760
And it's not even hardly on camera now that I see the episode.
而且现在我看这集的时候，发现镜头里根本没拍多久。

1325
00:59:31.960 --> 00:59:33.360
You're like, wait a second.
你就会想，等等。

1326
00:59:34.780 --> 00:59:41.240
But part of this big kiss was because we had this shorter season from the writer's strike,
但这个大吻的一部分原因，是因为编剧罢工导致这一季变短了，

1327
00:59:41.240 --> 00:59:46.880
and we didn't get to advance a lot of jammy storylines after all, right?
我们没能推进很多吉姆和帕姆的故事线，对吧？

1328
00:59:47.000 --> 00:59:49.600
They had this whole plan that they were going to move in together.
他们原本有个完整的计划，打算一起同居的。

1329
00:59:50.640 --> 00:59:55.320
So we're near the end of the season, and we had to throw in a big jam moment.
所以当时快到季末了，我们必须硬塞进一个吉姆和帕姆的高光时刻。

1330
00:59:55.620 --> 00:59:55.780
Right.
没错。

1331
00:59:55.920 --> 00:59:56.840
So here it is.
所以就是这样。

1332
00:59:56.980 --> 00:59:58.860
You're going to get to see them have a big smooch.
你们会看到他们来个大大的一吻。

1333
00:59:59.000 --> 01:00:02.620
This is, I think, the biggest smooch of the series.
我认为这是全剧最大的一次亲吻。

1334
01:00:03.140 --> 01:00:03.540
Really?
真的吗？

1335
01:00:03.940 --> 01:00:05.460
It's the longest smooch.
这是最长的吻。

1336
01:00:05.560 --> 01:00:09.140
I would say the biggest, most epic smooch was Casino Night.
我要说最大、最史诗级的吻是在赌场之夜。

1337
01:00:09.300 --> 01:00:11.260
That was not as long as this.
那个没有这个长。

1338
01:00:11.420 --> 01:00:12.520
Well, that's what I was about to say.
嗯，我正想这么说呢。

1339
01:00:12.520 --> 01:00:17.000
I feel like it was a big, pivotal smooch, but this is the longest smooch.
我觉得那个是一个重大、转折性的吻，但这个是最长的吻。

1340
01:00:17.280 --> 01:00:17.480
Yeah.
对。

1341
01:00:17.900 --> 01:00:20.280
And it was very, very funny.
而且非常非常搞笑。

1342
01:00:20.860 --> 01:00:22.660
Angela, this is my question.
安吉拉，这是我的问题。

1343
01:00:23.100 --> 01:00:29.680
Was it in the script for Michael to say, kiss or kiss or good?
剧本里写了让迈克尔说“亲一个还是亲一个还是好吧”吗？

1344
01:00:30.000 --> 01:00:32.360
Because I could not get through that.
因为我根本演不下去。

1345
01:00:32.440 --> 01:00:33.440
We were laughing so hard.
我们笑得太厉害了。

1346
01:00:33.500 --> 01:00:37.580
And my memory is that Steve did that as an improvisation.
我的记忆是史蒂夫那是即兴发挥的。

1347
01:00:38.060 --> 01:00:39.360
It's in the script.
剧本里写了。

1348
01:00:39.640 --> 01:00:41.240
Oh, my gosh.
哦，天哪。

1349
01:00:41.240 --> 01:00:42.560
It's in the script.
剧本里写了。

1350
01:00:42.780 --> 01:00:47.780
It says Michael has gotten very close to Jim and Pam and is watching them kiss from really
上面写着迈克尔离吉姆和帕姆非常近，而且离得很近地看着他们亲吻

1351
01:00:47.780 --> 01:00:48.720
far too close.
靠得太近了。

1352
01:00:48.900 --> 01:00:50.900
And Michael says, yeah, kiss her.
迈克尔说，对，亲她。

1353
01:00:51.060 --> 01:00:51.620
Kiss her good.
狠狠地亲。

1354
01:00:52.020 --> 01:00:53.620
It was very, very funny.
这真的，真的很好笑。

1355
01:00:53.880 --> 01:00:58.880
And you can see when John and I separate that my face is a little red.
你可以看到，当我和约翰分开时，我的脸有点红。

1356
01:00:59.060 --> 01:01:02.700
It's a little chased from so much kissing.
亲了这么多次，都有点泛红了。

1357
01:01:02.700 --> 01:01:04.780
We had to do this scene so many times.
这场戏我们不得不拍了好多遍。

1358
01:01:05.060 --> 01:01:08.620
And you can see, I think John had a little stubble.
你可以看到，我觉得约翰有点胡茬。

1359
01:01:08.780 --> 01:01:09.540
A little stubble.
有点胡茬。

1360
01:01:09.540 --> 01:01:11.520
Well, do you want to hear what was in the script?
好吧，你们想听听剧本里写的是什么吗？

1361
01:01:12.060 --> 01:01:12.240
Yeah.
想听。

1362
01:01:12.920 --> 01:01:14.920
Angela and Dwight were there for this moment.
安吉拉和德怀特当时也在场见证这一刻。

1363
01:01:15.300 --> 01:01:15.480
What?
什么？

1364
01:01:15.900 --> 01:01:16.340
Yes.
是的。

1365
01:01:16.480 --> 01:01:19.760
And while the guys are drinking beers, Angela shushes them.
当这几个家伙在喝啤酒时，安吉拉嘘了他们一声。

1366
01:01:20.680 --> 01:01:25.880
And then Angela and Dwight have their moment later in the script when they leave and Dwight
然后剧本后面还有安吉拉和德怀特的戏份，他们离开时德怀特

1367
01:01:25.880 --> 01:01:27.140
holds open the door and all that.
帮忙扶着门之类的。

1368
01:01:27.300 --> 01:01:31.980
But how awkward would it have been for Dwight and Angela to be there too?
但如果德怀特和安吉拉也在场，那该有多尴尬啊？

1369
01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:33.560
I'm glad they changed that.
我很高兴他们改了。

1370
01:01:33.560 --> 01:01:35.040
Yeah, that was a good move.
对，那是神来之笔。

1371
01:01:35.280 --> 01:01:35.720
Yeah.
是的。

1372
01:01:35.940 --> 01:01:38.040
You don't need more Angela judgment.
你不需要更多的安吉拉式批判。

1373
01:01:38.280 --> 01:01:39.500
Pam doesn't need more.
帕姆不需要更多了。

1374
01:01:39.840 --> 01:01:43.840
The last scene of this episode is a flashback back to the job fair.
这集的最后一个场景是闪回到招聘会。

1375
01:01:44.000 --> 01:01:47.980
This is going to set us up for Pam's storyline in season five.
这为我们铺垫了帕姆在第五季的故事线。

1376
01:01:47.980 --> 01:01:49.800
We're going to plant some seeds here.
我们要在这里埋下一些伏笔。

1377
01:01:49.940 --> 01:01:57.360
You see Pam go up to a booth for a graphic design firm and she wants to fill out an application.
你可以看到帕姆走到一家平面设计公司的展位前，想要填写一份申请表。

1378
01:01:57.980 --> 01:02:04.280
Yes, and you guys might notice that the graphic design guy is played by Nelson Franklin.
是的，大家可能会注意到，那个平面设计男是由纳尔逊·富兰克林饰演的。

1379
01:02:04.400 --> 01:02:07.840
He's going to come back in season six as the IT guy.
他将在第六季回归饰演IT男。

1380
01:02:08.080 --> 01:02:09.920
I have a little fun tidbit about Nelson.
关于纳尔逊，我有一个有趣的小八卦。

1381
01:02:10.360 --> 01:02:11.440
I know what it is.
我知道是什么。

1382
01:02:11.620 --> 01:02:12.220
Tell us.
快告诉我们。

1383
01:02:12.500 --> 01:02:18.220
Nelson and I were co-stars on a new show for Netflix, hashtag Black AF.
纳尔逊和我曾是网飞新剧《#黑人家族》的联合主演。

1384
01:02:18.220 --> 01:02:24.620
We played writers in the writer's room with Kenya Barris and Rashida Jones plays Kenya's wife,
我们在编剧室里饰演编剧，与肯尼亚·巴里斯合作，拉什达·琼斯饰演肯尼亚的妻子

1385
01:02:24.760 --> 01:02:27.120
Joya, and Ken Kwapis directed us.
乔亚，肯·夸皮斯执导了我们。

1386
01:02:27.260 --> 01:02:29.180
It was like a whole office reunion.
这就像是一次完整的《办公室》大团圆。

1387
01:02:29.460 --> 01:02:30.900
That show is so funny.
那部剧太搞笑了。

1388
01:02:31.440 --> 01:02:34.060
Your writer's room scenes are so funny.
你们编剧室的戏份太好笑了。

1389
01:02:34.220 --> 01:02:36.700
Angela, your character is amazing in that show.
安吉拉，你在那部剧里的角色太棒了。

1390
01:02:37.020 --> 01:02:39.220
Oh, I play yet another miserable woman.
哦，我又演了一个痛苦的女人。

1391
01:02:40.160 --> 01:02:41.680
You're so good at it.
你太擅长这个了。

1392
01:02:41.860 --> 01:02:42.640
Oh, thanks.
哦，谢谢。

1393
01:02:42.880 --> 01:02:45.600
I loved all the writer's room bits, you know,
我喜欢所有的编剧室桥段，你知道的，

1394
01:02:45.600 --> 01:02:48.680
because you and I, we've observed writer's rooms over the years
因为你和我，我们这些年观察过很多编剧室，

1395
01:02:48.680 --> 01:02:51.580
and it was really fun to kind of play out some of that shtick.
把那些套路演出来真的很有趣。

1396
01:02:51.880 --> 01:02:53.360
Well, Nelson is amazing.
总之，纳尔逊太棒了。

1397
01:02:53.660 --> 01:02:56.800
He also had a regular recurring role on Veep.
他还在《副总统》中扮演过常驻角色。

1398
01:02:57.040 --> 01:02:59.100
He had a regular role on Black-ish.
他在《黑人当道》中也有常驻角色。

1399
01:02:59.420 --> 01:03:00.320
And it's true.
千真万确。

1400
01:03:00.520 --> 01:03:02.200
He's going to come back in season six.
他将在第六季回归。

1401
01:03:02.400 --> 01:03:05.880
And I don't know how they did that.
而且我不知道他们是怎么做到的。

1402
01:03:06.060 --> 01:03:07.220
I'm going to figure it out.
我会搞清楚的。

1403
01:03:07.340 --> 01:03:09.520
When we get to season six, I'm going to tell you.
等我们到第六季的时候，我会告诉你。

1404
01:03:09.660 --> 01:03:12.140
It's a little bit of a bewitched moment, isn't it?
这有点像《神仙家庭》的时刻，不是吗？

1405
01:03:12.300 --> 01:03:12.660
It is.
确实是。

1406
01:03:13.000 --> 01:03:14.500
It's like, which Darren is this?
就像是，这是哪个达伦？

1407
01:03:14.500 --> 01:03:16.300
I will point out one thing.
我要指出一件事。

1408
01:03:16.540 --> 01:03:19.720
Nelson joins our very tall male cast member club.
纳尔逊加入了我们非常高的男性演员俱乐部。

1409
01:03:19.920 --> 01:03:21.400
He is six foot five.
他身高六英尺五英寸。

1410
01:03:21.700 --> 01:03:24.260
Every scene I have to be in with him, he has to be seated.
我和他的每一场戏，他都必须坐着。

1411
01:03:24.600 --> 01:03:26.560
Well, he's really good in this scene with Pam.
嗯，他在和帕姆这场戏里表现得真好。

1412
01:03:26.800 --> 01:03:28.360
You know, he kind of explains to her,
你知道，他有点向她解释说，

1413
01:03:28.520 --> 01:03:31.740
you just need like basic knowledge of all of these programs
你只需要所有这些程序的基本知识，

1414
01:03:31.740 --> 01:03:33.780
that Pam has no knowledge of at all.
而帕姆对这些一无所知。

1415
01:03:34.020 --> 01:03:37.560
And then he says, you know, you could probably get training somewhere.
然后他说，你知道，你大概可以在什么地方接受培训。

1416
01:03:37.720 --> 01:03:39.220
Do like an adult education class.
比如上个成人教育班。

1417
01:03:39.340 --> 01:03:40.800
But the best place to go,
但最好的去处，

1418
01:03:40.960 --> 01:03:43.300
and this is where we plant the seeds for next season,
这就是我们为下一季埋下伏笔的地方，

1419
01:03:43.300 --> 01:03:48.700
the best place to learn about graphic design are programs in New York or Philadelphia.
学习平面设计的最佳去处是纽约或费城的项目。

1420
01:03:49.200 --> 01:03:49.640
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

1421
01:03:49.980 --> 01:03:52.460
And she's like, got it, New York or Philadelphia.
她就像是，明白了，纽约或费城。

1422
01:03:53.260 --> 01:03:53.640
Yep.
没错。

1423
01:03:54.200 --> 01:03:56.040
What is Pam going to do?
帕姆会怎么做？

1424
01:03:56.340 --> 01:03:57.420
We'll find out.
我们会知道的。

1425
01:03:57.640 --> 01:03:58.420
We will.
我们会的。

1426
01:03:58.600 --> 01:04:00.640
And that was job fair.
这就是招聘会那一集。

1427
01:04:00.880 --> 01:04:03.080
And lady, I can't believe I'm saying this,
天哪，真不敢相信我在这么说，

1428
01:04:03.200 --> 01:04:06.160
but up next is the finale of season four.
但接下来是第四季的季终集。

1429
01:04:06.160 --> 01:04:06.260
Sure.
确实。

1430
01:04:06.420 --> 01:04:07.200
I know.
我知道。

1431
01:04:07.540 --> 01:04:08.020
Already.
已经到了。

1432
01:04:08.360 --> 01:04:11.440
Thank you guys so much for sending in your questions and comments.
非常感谢大家发来你们的问题和评论。

1433
01:04:11.620 --> 01:04:16.840
Thanks so much to our cast members for letting us bug them about golf and pumpkin out
非常感谢我们的演员们让我们拿高尔夫和南瓜来打扰他们，

1434
01:04:16.840 --> 01:04:18.720
and everything else we hit them up for.
还有我们向他们打听的其它所有事情。

1435
01:04:19.120 --> 01:04:20.600
Yeah, they're amazing.
是的，他们太棒了。

1436
01:04:21.020 --> 01:04:22.200
They are the beSt.
他们是最棒的。

1437
01:04:22.420 --> 01:04:24.600
And Lori and Steven Sox, we love you guys.
还有洛里和史蒂文·索克斯，我们爱你们。

1438
01:04:24.600 --> 01:04:27.760
We'll be putting a swipe up to their podcast if we knew then.
如果我们当时知道的话，我们会在他们的播客上放一个上滑链接。

1439
01:04:28.180 --> 01:04:29.360
See you next week, guys.
伙计们，下周见。

1440
01:04:29.640 --> 01:04:31.060
Have a fantastic week.
祝你们度过美好的一周。

1441
01:04:31.340 --> 01:04:32.100
See you then.
到时候见。

1442
01:04:32.400 --> 01:04:38.020
Thank you for listening to Office Ladies' Second Drink.
感谢收听《办公室女士》的第二杯饮品。

